### Phase 0 verification checklist (quick, high-signal)

| Check | What "complete" means | Where to verify |
|---|---|---|
| Project initialized | `package.json` + `package-lock.json` exist | project root |
| CommonJS enforced | `package.json` contains `"type": "commonjs"` | `package.json` |
| Required scripts | `dev`, `start`, `test`, `test:watch`, `test:coverage` present | `package.json` |
| Git ignore basics | `.gitignore` includes `node_modules/`, `.env`, `logs/`, and `env.template.txt` | `.gitignore` |
| Env template present | `env.template.txt` lists `DATABASE_URL`, `JWT_SECRET`, `CORS_ORIGINS`, `NODE_ENV`, `PORT`, `STORAGE_PROVIDER` | `env.template.txt` |
| Prisma scaffold exists | `prisma/schema.prisma` exists | `prisma/schema.prisma` |
| Prisma 7 datasource rule | `prisma/schema.prisma` datasource has **no** `url = ...` | `prisma/schema.prisma` |
| Prisma CLI config safe | `prisma.config.js` uses `require('./src/config/env')` (no raw `process.env`) | `prisma.config.js` |
| Prisma client wrapper | `src/prisma/client.js` uses adapter + mysql2 pool + singleton pattern | `src/prisma/client.js` |
| Config is centralized | `src/config/env.js` exists and is the **only** place reading `process.env` | `src/config/env.js` + repo grep |
| CORS rule ready | `cors` dependency installed and `src/config/cors.js` stub exists | `package.json`, `src/config/cors.js` |
| Jest configured | `jest.config.js` exists and points to `src/tests/setup.js` | `jest.config.js` |
| Aliases (IDE) | `jsconfig.json` paths include `@app`, `@lib`, `@config`, `@middlewares`, `@prisma/client`, `@logs` | `jsconfig.json` |
| Aliases (runtime) | `src/server.js` registers `module-alias` **first**, then base aliases + `registerAllModuleAliases()` | `src/server.js` |
| Required folder structure | `src/app`, `src/modules`, `src/lib`, `src/config`, `src/middlewares`, `src/tests`, `src/prisma` exist | `src/` tree |
| Lib barrel files | `src/lib/index.js` exists and every `src/lib/*/index.js` exists (including `health/`, `i18n/`, `aliases/`) | `src/lib/**/index.js` |
| Router planned | `src/app/router.js` exists and is responsible for mounting `/api/v<version>/*` (initial release: `/api/v1/*`) and system health endpoints | `src/app/router.js` |
| Prisma guide | `prisma/guide.md` exists | `prisma/guide.md` |
| Versioned docs | `CHANGELOG.md` and `docs/api/v1/openapi.yaml` exist | project root, `docs/api/v1/` |

